  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the range of the antenna is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) and solve to obtain the required height of the antenna.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6400000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>h</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>160</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>125</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>"
